    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/e04d642fb85a7f4ee79febee6e4b79e0.avif?t=1709101595\" /></div><br>Koatl the Defender, the Lost Tunnels is an action platform video game set in the Koatl the Defender universe, published by Codex Studio.<br><br>The Title continues the adventures of Koatl read in the comic with a completely new story where a mysterious danger lurks below the city of San Luis Potos\u00ed and Koatl will have to go to the lost tunnels below the city to stop it.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/c3c39f592c38c2411b94c162d357592b.poster.avif?t=1709101595\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/c3c39f592c38c2411b94c162d357592b.webm?t=1709101595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/c3c39f592c38c2411b94c162d357592b.mp4?t=1709101595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/179e9e4ac611f9cfabcec6a2f2840bd3.avif?t=1709101595\" /></div><br>Travel through the lost tunnels under San Luis Potos\u00ed in a traditional sidescroller style with platforming elements and combat against enemies, and while facing more powerful enemies you will switch to a full 3d game mode!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/c3bdc3ab6dc7c61d7204855383b083c0.poster.avif?t=1709101595\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/c3bdc3ab6dc7c61d7204855383b083c0.webm?t=1709101595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/c3bdc3ab6dc7c61d7204855383b083c0.mp4?t=1709101595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Find different Weapons in each tunnel that will give you new abilities to continue exploring and fighting.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/7efb4fa62395b85100faeb27dbba4820.poster.avif?t=1709101595\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/7efb4fa62395b85100faeb27dbba4820.webm?t=1709101595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/7efb4fa62395b85100faeb27dbba4820.mp4?t=1709101595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>There are many objects lost in the tunnels, be it treasures stolen centuries ago, Koatl comic collections, or lost texts that can help you uncover the full mystery that led to the events that are unfolding.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/607a38667616d467cfa4fc1bf6e952c9.poster.avif?t=1709101595\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/607a38667616d467cfa4fc1bf6e952c9.webm?t=1709101595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/607a38667616d467cfa4fc1bf6e952c9.mp4?t=1709101595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/75bfb6cf468a7390d09eb9555f993b14.avif?t=1709101595\" /></div><br>In your adventure you will have the help of a couple of tunnel dwellers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/e9ed48c3136c86c58d3e08296b731001.avif?t=1709101595\" /></div><br>Dr. Sitho Farabeuf is a ghost who is dedicated to buying and selling goods. His items will be of singular help when exploring the tunnels.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/98d6e29c2e43849e417f7333b94a6cf7.avif?t=1709101595\" /></div><br>Evangeline Vierge de Fer was a scribe 300 years ago who has lost her memory, only she can help you solve the entire mystery of the lost tunnels.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/e04d642fb85a7f4ee79febee6e4b79e0.avif?t=1709101595\" /></div><br>Koatl the Defender, the Lost Tunnels is an action platform video game set in the Koatl the Defender universe, published by Codex Studio.<br><br>The Title continues the adventures of Koatl read in the comic with a completely new story where a mysterious danger lurks below the city of San Luis Potos\u00ed and Koatl will have to go to the lost tunnels below the city to stop it.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/c3c39f592c38c2411b94c162d357592b.poster.avif?t=1709101595\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/c3c39f592c38c2411b94c162d357592b.webm?t=1709101595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/c3c39f592c38c2411b94c162d357592b.mp4?t=1709101595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/179e9e4ac611f9cfabcec6a2f2840bd3.avif?t=1709101595\" /></div><br>Travel through the lost tunnels under San Luis Potos\u00ed in a traditional sidescroller style with platforming elements and combat against enemies, and while facing more powerful enemies you will switch to a full 3d game mode!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/c3bdc3ab6dc7c61d7204855383b083c0.poster.avif?t=1709101595\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/c3bdc3ab6dc7c61d7204855383b083c0.webm?t=1709101595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/c3bdc3ab6dc7c61d7204855383b083c0.mp4?t=1709101595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Find different Weapons in each tunnel that will give you new abilities to continue exploring and fighting.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/7efb4fa62395b85100faeb27dbba4820.poster.avif?t=1709101595\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/7efb4fa62395b85100faeb27dbba4820.webm?t=1709101595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/7efb4fa62395b85100faeb27dbba4820.mp4?t=1709101595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>There are many objects lost in the tunnels, be it treasures stolen centuries ago, Koatl comic collections, or lost texts that can help you uncover the full mystery that led to the events that are unfolding.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/607a38667616d467cfa4fc1bf6e952c9.poster.avif?t=1709101595\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/607a38667616d467cfa4fc1bf6e952c9.webm?t=1709101595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/607a38667616d467cfa4fc1bf6e952c9.mp4?t=1709101595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/75bfb6cf468a7390d09eb9555f993b14.avif?t=1709101595\" /></div><br>In your adventure you will have the help of a couple of tunnel dwellers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/e9ed48c3136c86c58d3e08296b731001.avif?t=1709101595\" /></div><br>Dr. Sitho Farabeuf is a ghost who is dedicated to buying and selling goods. His items will be of singular help when exploring the tunnels.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025710/extras/98d6e29c2e43849e417f7333b94a6cf7.avif?t=1709101595\" /></div><br>Evangeline Vierge de Fer was a scribe 300 years ago who has lost her memory, only she can help you solve the entire mystery of the lost tunnels.",
